:0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3009421552","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107726#issuecomment-3009421552","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107726","id":3009421552,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6zYCDw","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-26T18:19:52Z","updated_at":"2025-06-26T18:19:52Z","body":"It's the exact same behavior, the two methods are the same, or should be, if they aren't that's a bug, that would be good to test","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3009421552/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3009949701","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107726#issuecomment-3009949701","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107726","id":3009949701,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6zaDAF","user":{"login":"FeldrinH","id":5256211,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNTYyMTE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5256211?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/FeldrinH","html_url":"https://github.com/FeldrinH","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FeldrinH/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FeldrinH/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FeldrinH/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FeldrinH/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FeldrinH/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FeldrinH/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FeldrinH/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FeldrinH/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FeldrinH/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-26T20:45:56Z","updated_at":"2025-06-26T20:45:56Z","body":"Well, I get the following:\n```gdscript\n\"0\".get_slice(\",\", 2) == \"0\"\n\"0\".get_slicec(\",\".unicode_at(0), 2) == \"\"\n```\nSo they are in fact different.\n\nI guess now the question is which one is the bug, because both are following their documented behavior. ","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3009949701/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3010261049","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107726#issuecomment-3010261049","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107726","id":3010261049,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6zbPA5","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-26T21:54:26Z","updated_at":"2025-06-26T21:54:26Z","body":"That's a good point! And I think I missed a detail and missed this wasn't for position 0 but non-zero, that would be more of a bug IMO but it does match what the documentation says it will do, and as you say it does technically for `get_slicec` too as it does not mention that part (though it does work the same way for the `0` slice)\n\nSo less clear cut indeed, I'd say that it's hard to say what is fully correct though, as except for mentioning that it's *faster* than `split` there's no promise that it is indeed equivalent to `split` in that sense\n\nPersonally for the general case I don't know that I think it's more or less reasonable that non-zero slice index returns the full string, but I do think it might make more sense that `get_slice` and `get_slicec` behave the same, and in this case I'd say to make `get_slicec` work the same way","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3010261049/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3010312873","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107726#issuecomment-3010312873","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107726","id":3010312873,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6zbbqp","user":{"login":"FeldrinH","id":5256211,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNTYyMTE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5256211?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/FeldrinH","html_url":"https://github.com/FeldrinH","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FeldrinH/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FeldrinH/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FeldrinH/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FeldrinH/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FeldrinH/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FeldrinH/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FeldrinH/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FeldrinH/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FeldrinH/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-26T22:15:28Z","updated_at":"2025-06-26T22:16:45Z","body":"> Personally for the general case I don't know that I think it's more or less reasonable that non-zero slice index returns the full string, but I do think it might make more sense that `get_slice` and `get_slicec` behave the same, and in this case I'd say to make `get_slicec` work the same way\n\nAt least to for me the get_slicec behavior makes more sense, because it has fewer special cases and matches the behavior of split. This is in my opinion a reasonable expectation that get_slice should also fulfill. I can think of quite a lot of examples where the current get_slicec behavior is useful (see first post of this issue) and no examples where the current get_slice behavior is useful.\n\nAlso worth noting that I believe the first Godot internal code example you shared depends on the current behavior of get_slicec to work and would break if you used the get_slice behavior instead.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3010312873/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3012164877","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107726#issuecomment-3012164877","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107726","id":3012164877,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6zif0N","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-27T08:24:06Z","updated_at":"2025-06-27T08:24:06Z","body":"That's a good point","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3012164877/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]